----INTRA-PROTEIN CONTACT MATRIX FOR MEMBRANE-BOUND Apo state-----

This directory contains the raw contact matrices generated by fast_cont_mat.py in three folders.
    i) LC3B_ER_SIM1_1us_dt1000_cont_mat (Replica 1)
    ii) LC3B-ER-SIM2-dt1000_cont_mat (Replica 2)
    iii) LC3B-ER-SIM3-dt1000_onlyProtein_cont_mat (Replica 3)
The merged csv files are generated with cont_map_maker.py for each replicate
    i) LC3B_ER_SIM1_1us_dt1000_cont_mat.csv (Replica 1)
    ii) LC3B-ER-SIM2-dt1000_cont_mat.csv (Replica 2)
    iii) LC3B-ER-SIM3-dt1000_onlyProtein_cont_mat.csv (Replica 3)

Finally, the consensus contact matrix from three replicated generated using consensus_cont_mat_maker.py is saved as LC3B_UNB_ER_cont_mat_new_c.csv